    "summary": "A chameleon who moves between jazz fusion and global pop without dilution in either direction. Weather Report's drummer in the early 1980s while also making Bowie's Let's Dance, then the groove behind Sting's first solo album and the drums on almost all of Dire Straits' Brothers in Arms. Combines fusion-level technique with immaculate pop time."
